<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Truvex — Inteligência de Frota</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Truvex transforma sua frota em inteligência de negócio. Gestão completa de locações, manutenções e finanças em um só lugar.">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Epilogue:wght@300;400;700;800;900&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/@phosphor-icons/web" defer></script>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg">
    <style>
    /* ============================================================
       DESIGN SYSTEM
    ============================================================ */
    :root {
        --green:       #00C278;
        --green-dark:  #007A4D;
        --green-glow:  rgba(0,194,120,0.18);
        --bg:          #F0EDE6;
        --white:       #FFFFFF;
        --ink:         #0E0E0E;
        --ink2:        #1A1A1A;
        --muted:       #777065;
        --border:      rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        --card-bg:     rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
        --dark:        #0A0A0A;
        --site-max:    1280px;
    }

    *, *::before, *::after { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
        background: var(--bg);
        color: var(--ink);
        font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
        font-size: 16px;
        overflow-x: hidden;
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    a { text-decoration: none; color: inherit; }

    .wrap {
        max-width: var(--site-max);
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 0 60px;
    }
    @media (max-width: 1024px) { .wrap { padding: 0 32px; } }
    @media (max-width: 640px)  { .wrap { padding: 0 20px; } }

    /* ============================================================
       BUTTONS
    ============================================================ */
    .btn {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 15px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 14px 28px;
        transition: all 0.25s;
        cursor: pointer;
        border: none;
    }
    .btn-primary {
        background: var(--green);
        color: #000;
        font-family: 'Epilogue', sans-serif;
        font-weight: 800;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,194,120,0.3);
    }
    .btn-primary:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0,194,120,0.4); background: #00d985; }
    .btn-ghost {
        background: transparent;
        color: var(--ink);
        border: 1.5px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
    }
    .btn-ghost:hover { background: var(--white); border-color: rgba(0,0,0,0.25); }
    .btn-lg { padding: 18px 40px; font-size: 17px; border-radius: 12px; }

    /* ============================================================
       NAV
    ============================================================ */
    .nav {
        position: sticky;
        top: 0;
        z-index: 100;
        padding: 18px 0;
        background: rgba(240,237,230,0.85);
        backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
        -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
        transition: background 0.3s;
    }
    .nav-inner {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        max-width: var(--site-max);
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 0 60px;
    }
    @media (max-width: 1024px) { .nav-inner { padding: 0 32px; } }

    .logo {
        font-family: 'Epilogue', sans-serif;
        font-weight: 900;
        font-size: 26px;
        letter-spacing: -1.5px;
    }
    .logo .dot-v { color: var(--green); }

    .nav-links {
        display: flex;
        gap: 36px;
    }
    .nav-links a {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 14px;
        font-weight: 500;
        transition: color 0.2s;
    }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--ink); }
    @media (max-width: 768px) { .nav-links { display: none; } }

    /* ============================================================
       HERO
    ============================================================ */
    .hero {
        padding: 100px 0 80px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        text-align: center;
    }

    .hero-tag {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        background: rgba(0,194,120,0.1);
        border: 1px solid rgba(0,194,120,0.25);
        color: var(--green-dark);
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        padding: 7px 16px 7px 10px;
        border-radius: 100px;
        margin-bottom: 44px;
    }
    .hero-tag-dot {
        width: 7px; height: 7px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: var(--green);
        animation: blink 2s infinite;
    }
    @keyframes blink { 0%,100%{opacity:1} 50%{opacity:0.2} }

    .hero-headline {
        font-family: 'Epilogue', sans-serif;
        font-weight: 900;
        font-size: clamp(64px, 9vw, 120px);
        letter-spacing: -5px;
        line-height: 0.93;
        max-width: 900px;
        margin-bottom: 32px;
    }
    .hero-headline .hl   { color: var(--green); }
    .hero-headline .dim  { color: #A8A49B; } /* VISIBLE, not invisible */

    .hero-sub {
        font-size: clamp(16px, 2vw, 19px);
        font-weight: 300;
        color: var(--muted);
        line-height: 1.75;
        max-width: 520px;
        margin-bottom: 48px;
    }
    .hero-sub strong { font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); }

    .hero-cta {
        display: flex;
        gap: 14px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        justify-content: center;
        margin-bottom: 56px;
    }

    .hero-social {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 14px;
        font-size: 13px;
        color: var(--muted);
    }
    .avatar-row { display: flex; }
    .av {
        width: 34px; height: 34px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ccc 0%, #aaa 100%);
        border: 2px solid var(--bg);
        margin-left: -10px;
        font-size: 11px;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: #fff;
        display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
        letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }
    .av:first-child { margin-left: 0; }
    .av.a1 { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea, #764ba2); }
    .av.a2 { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f093fb, #f5576c); }
    .av.a3 { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4facfe, #00f2fe); }
    .av.a4 { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #43e97b, #38f9d7); }
    .star-row { color: var(--green); letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 11px; margin-bottom: 2px; }

    /* ============================================================
       LOGOS BAND
    ============================================================ */
    .logos-band {
        padding: 40px 0;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
    }
    .logos-inner {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 56px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        padding: 0 40px;
    }
    .logo-item {
        font-family: 'Epilogue', sans-serif;
        font-weight: 800;
        font-size: 18px;
        color: var(--border);
        letter-spacing: -1px;
        white-space: nowrap;
        filter: grayscale(1);
        opacity: 0.4;
    }

    /* ============================================================
       SECTION COMMONS
    ============================================================ */
    .section { padding: 100px 0; }
    .section-white { background: var(--white); }
    .section-dark  { background: var(--dark); color: #fff; }

    .eyebrow {
        font-size: 11px;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 3px;
        color: var(--green);
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        margin-bottom: 18px;
    }
    .eyebrow::before {
        content: '';
        width: 20px; height: 2px;
        background: var(--green);
        display: block;
    }
    .eyebrow.center { justify-content: center; }
    .eyebrow.center::before { display: none; }
    .eyebrow.center::after { content: ''; width: 20px; height: 2px; background: var(--green); display: block; }

    .sh {
        font-family: 'Epilogue', sans-serif;
        font-weight: 800;
        font-size: clamp(32px, 4.5vw, 54px);
        letter-spacing: -2px;
        line-height: 1.05;
        margin-bottom: 18px;
    }
    .st {
        font-size: 17px;
        font-weight: 300;
        color: var(--muted);
        line-height: 1.75;
        max-width: 540px;
    }

    /* ============================================================
       PROBLEM CARDS
    ============================================================ */
    .problem-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
        gap: 20px;
        margin-top: 60px;
    }
    @media (max-width: 900px)  { .problem-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
    @media (max-width: 520px)  { .problem-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

    .problem-card {
        background: var(--white);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 20px;
        padding: 32px 28px;
        transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
    }
    .problem-card:hover { transform: translateY(-6px); box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.07); }

    .pc-icon {
        width: 52px; height: 52px;
        border-radius: 14px;
        background: #FEF3F2;
        display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
        margin-bottom: 22px;
        color: #E53E3E;
        font-size: 24px;
    }
    .pc-icon.info { background: #EBF8FF; color: #3182CE; }
    .pc-icon.warn { background: #FFFBEB; color: #D97706; }
    .pc-icon.dark { background: #F3F0FF; color: #7C3AED; }

    .problem-card h3 {
        font-family: 'Epilogue', sans-serif;
        font-size: 17px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .problem-card p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.65; }

    /* ============================================================
       HOW IT WORKS
    ============================================================ */
    .steps {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
        margin-top: 64px;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 24px;
        overflow: hidden;
    }
    @media (max-width: 900px) { .steps { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
    @media (max-width: 520px) { .steps { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

    .step {
        padding: 40px 36px;
        border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
        background: var(--white);
        position: relative;
    }
    .step:last-child { border-right: none; }

    .step-num {
        font-family: 'Epilogue', sans-serif;
        font-size: 13px;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--green);
        letter-spacing: 1px;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
    }
    .step-num::before {
        content: '';
        width: 6px; height: 6px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: var(--green);
    }
    .step h3 {
        font-family: 'Epilogue', sans-serif;
        font-size: 19px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .step p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.65; }

    /* ============================================================
       FEATURES
    ============================================================ */
    .features-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
        gap: 20px;
        margin-top: 60px;
    }
    @media (max-width: 900px) { .features-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
    @media (max-width: 540px) { .features-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

    .fc {
        background: var(--bg);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 20px;
        padding: 36px;
        transition: all 0.3s;
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
    }
    .fc::before {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
        height: 3px;
        background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--green), #00e5a0);
        transform: scaleX(0);
        transform-origin: left;
        transition: transform 0.35s;
    }
    .fc:hover { transform: translateY(-6px); box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); background: var(--white); }
    .fc:hover::before { transform: scaleX(1); }
    .fc.accent {
        background: var(--ink);
        border-color: transparent;
        color: #fff;
    }
    .fc.accent::before { background: var(--green); transform: scaleX(1); }

    .fc-icon {
        width: 52px; height: 52px;
        border-radius: 14px;
        background: rgba(0,194,120,0.12);
        display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
        margin-bottom: 22px;
        color: var(--green);
        font-size: 26px;
    }
    .fc.accent .fc-icon { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); }
    .fc h3 { font-family: 'Epilogue', sans-serif; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.5px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .fc p  { font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.65; }
    .fc.accent p { color: #777; }

    /* ============================================================
       NUMBERS
    ============================================================ */
    .numbers-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
        gap: 1px;
        margin-top: 60px;
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
        border-radius: 24px;
        overflow: hidden;
    }
    @media (max-width: 768px) { .numbers-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }

    .ni {
        padding: 52px 40px;
        text-align: center;
        border-right: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
        transition: background 0.3s;
    }
    .ni:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); }
    .ni:last-child { border-right: none; }

    .ni-num {
        font-family: 'Epilogue', sans-serif;
        font-size: clamp(48px, 6vw, 72px);
        font-weight: 900;
        letter-spacing: -3px;
        line-height: 1;
        color: var(--green);
        display: block;
    }
    .ni-label {
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #555;
        margin-top: 10px;
    }

    /* ============================================================
       TESTIMONIALS
    ============================================================ */
    .testis {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
        gap: 24px;
        margin-top: 60px;
    }
    @media (max-width: 900px) { .testis { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

    .testi-card {
        background: var(--white);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 20px;
        padding: 36px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 24px;
    }
    .testi-stars { color: #f59e0b; letter-spacing: 2px; font-size: 14px; }
    .testi-text { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ink2); flex: 1; }
    .testi-text strong { color: var(--green-dark); font-weight: 600; }
    .testi-author { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; }
    .testi-av {
        width: 44px; height: 44px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
        font-weight: 800; font-size: 16px; color: #fff;
        flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .testi-author .meta strong { display: block; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }
    .testi-author .meta span  { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); }

    /* ============================================================
       FAQ
    ============================================================ */
    .faq-stack { margin-top: 56px; max-width: 740px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
    .faq-item {
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        cursor: pointer;
    }
    .faq-q {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        padding: 26px 0;
        font-family: 'Epilogue', sans-serif;
        font-size: 17px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.3px;
        gap: 20px;
    }
    .faq-ico { flex-shrink: 0; color: var(--green); font-size: 22px; transition: transform 0.3s; }
    .faq-item.open .faq-ico { transform: rotate(45deg); }
    .faq-a {
        font-size: 15px;
        color: var(--muted);
        line-height: 1.75;
        max-height: 0;
        overflow: hidden;
        transition: max-height 0.4s ease, padding-bottom 0.3s;
    }
    .faq-item.open .faq-a { max-height: 240px; padding-bottom: 24px; }

    /* ============================================================
       CTA FINAL
    ============================================================ */
    .cta-section {
        padding: 140px 0;
        background: var(--dark);
        text-align: center;
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
    }
    .cta-bg {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background:
            radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 50% at 15% 50%, rgba(0,194,120,0.12) 0%, transparent 60%),
            radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 60% at 90% 30%, rgba(0,194,120,0.08) 0%, transparent 60%);
    }
    .cta-inner { position: relative; z-index: 2; }
    .cta-section h2 {
        font-family: 'Epilogue', sans-serif;
        font-size: clamp(42px, 7vw, 84px);
        font-weight: 900;
        letter-spacing: -4px;
        color: #fff;
        line-height: 0.95;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .cta-section h2 span { color: var(--green); }
    .cta-section p { font-size: 18px; color: #666; margin-bottom: 52px; line-height: 1.7; }
    .cta-badges {
        display: flex;
        gap: 24px;
        justify-content: center;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        margin-top: 28px;
    }
    .cta-badge {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #555;
    }
    .cta-badge i { color: var(--green); }

    /* ============================================================
       FOOTER
    ============================================================ */
    .footer {
        background: var(--dark);
        border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
        padding: 48px 0;
    }
    .footer-inner {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
    }
    .footer-logo { font-family: 'Epilogue', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: -1.5px; color: #fff; }
    .footer-logo span { color: var(--green); }
    .footer-copy { font-size: 13px; color: #444; }
    .footer-cta { color: var(--green); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; transition: opacity 0.2s; }
    .footer-cta:hover { opacity: 0.75; }
    @media (max-width: 640px) { .footer-inner { flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; text-align: center; } }

    /* ============================================================
       SCROLL ANIMATIONS
    ============================================================ */
    [data-anim] {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(28px);
        transition: opacity 0.65s ease, transform 0.65s ease;
    }
    [data-anim].in { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ===== NAV ===== -->
<header class="nav">
    <div class="nav-inner">
        <a href="/" class="logo">Tru<span class="dot-v">v</span>ex<span class="dot-v">.</span></a>
        <nav class="nav-links">
            <a href="#problema">O Problema</a>
            <a href="#funcionalidades">Funcionalidades</a>
            <a href="#resultados">Resultados</a>
            <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
        </nav>
        <a href="/login" class="btn btn-primary" style="padding:12px 24px; font-size:14px;">Acessar plataforma <i class="ph ph-arrow-right"></i></a>
    </div>
</header>

<!-- ===== HERO ===== -->
<section class="hero wrap">
    <div class="hero-tag">
        <span class="hero-tag-dot"></span>
        Plataforma de gestão de frotas
    </div>
    <h1 class="hero-headline">
        Cada<br>
        <span class="hl">movimento</span><br>
        <span class="dim">conta.</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">
        Truvex é o sistema que transforma sua frota em <strong>inteligência de negócio.</strong> Do contrato ao financeiro, tudo num único lugar.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
        <a href="/login" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Começar agora — grátis <i class="ph ph-arrow-right"></i></a>
        <a href="#funcionalidades" class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg">Ver como funciona</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-social">
        <div class="avatar-row">
            <div class="av a1">MA</div>
            <div class="av a2">JC</div>
            <div class="av a3">RS</div>
            <div class="av a4">FP</div>
        </div>
        <div>
            <div class="star-row">★★★★★</div>
            <span>+200 locadoras confiam no Truvex</span>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== LOGOS ===== -->
<div class="logos-band">
    <div class="logos-inner">
        <span class="logo-item">AutoFlex</span>
        <span class="logo-item">Rede Vans</span>
        <span class="logo-item">FleetBras</span>
        <span class="logo-item">Movelog</span>
        <span class="logo-item">VeícuPro</span>
        <span class="logo-item">CarShare+</span>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- ===== PROBLEM ===== -->
<section class="section" id="problema">
    <div class="wrap">
        <div data-anim>
            <div class="eyebrow">O problema</div>
            <h2 class="sh">Você ainda controla<br>sua frota no improviso?</h2>
            <p class="st">Locadoras que dependem de planilhas e WhatsApp estão perdendo dinheiro — e muitas nem percebem.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="problem-grid">
            <div class="problem-card" data-anim>
                <div class="pc-icon"><i class="ph ph-table"></i></div>
                <h3>Dados espalhados</h3>
                <p>Planilhas desatualizadas, anotações em papel e e-mails perdidos que ninguém sabe onde estão.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="problem-card" data-anim>
                <div class="pc-icon info"><i class="ph ph-eye-slash"></i></div>
                <h3>Sem visão em tempo real</h3>
                <p>Você não sabe quais veículos estão disponíveis agora, nem quantos contratos vencem essa semana.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="problem-card" data-anim>
